         </div>

         <div type="translation" resp="part:emfr">
         	
         	<p n="1-2">
         		        Twenty-fourth year of the victorious king Naraiciṅkaparumaṉ.<note>Sanskrit Narasiṁhavarman, that is, the Pallava king Narasiṁhavarman I according to <bibl><ptr target="bib:Rāmēṣ2008_01"/></bibl>.</note>	
         	</p>

         	<p n="3-4">
         		        	Kalimanta Ati Araicaṉ, the lord of Vañcikkuḻi, died when marching <supplied reason="explanation"><foreign>ceṉṟu</foreign><note>Literally: going.</note></supplied> upon Aṟayūr.
         	</p>

         </div>
      	
